        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Across the top are letters and figures, worked in dark blue linen, below are borders done with flat stitch and drawn work.  Across the bottom is a vase of flowers, a peacock, a tree, two parrots and a mermaid. Stitches include double running, eyelet, Italian cross and cut and pulled work"@en ;
